Run setup by stage (previews unless --apply is given)

Usage:
  wskit setup [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for setup

Global Flags:
      --apply           make the changes; without it, commands only preview
      --config string   read configuration from this file
      --json            write the result as versioned JSON on standard output and events as JSON lines on standard error
      --plain           write plain lines with no styling and no prompts (also WSKIT_PLAIN=1)
      --quiet           show only results and errors
      --stage stage     select one setup stage by its ID
      --verbose         show more detail
